的人回來稟告說：「我已照你的吩咐做了。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}